	(text "USB: device, CC1/CC2 5.1k (Rd). VBUS only feeds the 3V3 diode-OR.\nShield to GND via 1M // 4.7nF (no hard ground loop over the cable shield)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2ef6ebc9-ebb3-53f6-abce-64d94a72885e")
	)
	(text "CAN connectors, seen into the mating face (PCB below), as on BTT EBB boards:\n  top row:    CAN-H (pad 4) | CAN-L (pad 3)\n  bottom row: 24V (pad 2, NOT CONNECTED, AD-07) | GND (pad 1)\nTermination 120R: the dock board is normally the end of the bus: jumper fitted.\nTJA1051T/3: VCC 5 V, VIO 3.3 V, S to GND (normal mode)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 254 0)
